---
import GovLayout from '../layouts/GovLayout.astro';
---
<GovLayout title="규정·공공조달·점검 | 대한불교밀교종">
  <div class="compliance-app" data-app hidden>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a href="/accounting-compliance/" class="brand"><img src="/logo.png" alt="대한불교밀교종 로고" /><span><img src="/brand-wordmark.png" alt="대한불교밀교종" /><b>규정·공공조달·점검</b></span></a>
      <div class="top-actions"><span data-user-label></span><a href="/" class="btn btn-outline">전자문서</a><a href="/accounting/" class="btn btn-outline">기본 회계</a><a href="/accounting-special/" class="btn btn-outline">특화회계</a><a href="/accounting-operations/" class="btn btn-outline">실무관리</a><a href="/accounting-tax/" class="btn btn-outline">세무·신고자료</a><button class="btn btn-outline" data-logout>로그아웃</button></div>
    </header>
    <div class="shell">
      <aside class="sidebar">
        <div class="year-box"><label for="compliance-year">회계연도</label><select id="compliance-year" data-year></select></div>
        <nav>
          <button class="nav active" data-tab="overview">규정대응 현황</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="revenue">수익사업 관리</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="procurement">공공조달 관리</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="reserve">고유목적사업준비금</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="check">회계점검·즉시보고</button>
          <button class="nav" data-tab="vehicle">업무용 차량</button>
        </nav>
        <p class="side-note">정관·재무회계규정에 따라 승인근거, 의결번호, 증빙과 점검이력을 연결해 관리합니다.</p>
      </aside>
      <main class="main">
        <div class="notice" data-notice hidden></div>

        <section class="panel active" data-panel="overview">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>REGULATION COMPLIANCE</p><h1>정관·재무회계규정 대응 현황</h1><span>수익사업, 공공조달, 준비금, 정기점검, 즉시보고, 업무용 차량을 기존 회계자료와 연결합니다.</span></div></div>
          <div class="summary-grid">
            <button data-jump="revenue"><span>수익사업 관리</span><strong data-summary-revenue>0건</strong><small>검토·승인·운영 중</small></button>
            <button data-jump="procurement"><span>공공조달 검토</span><strong data-summary-procurement>0건</strong><small>검토·승인·계약 중</small></button>
            <button data-jump="reserve"><span>준비금 잔액</span><strong data-summary-reserve>0원</strong><small>설정액-사용·환입액</small></button>
            <button data-jump="check"><span>미종결 점검·보고</span><strong data-summary-check>0건</strong><small>점검+즉시보고</small></button>
            <button data-jump="vehicle"><span>업무용 차량</span><strong data-summary-vehicle>0대</strong><small>운행·보험·계약 관리</small></button>
            <button data-jump="procurement"><span>45일 내 보증만료</span><strong data-summary-guarantee>0건</strong><small>회수·하자종료 확인</small></button>
          </div>
          <div class="card guide-grid">
            <button data-jump="revenue"><b>1. 수익사업 사전검토</b><span>정관 근거, 예상수입·지출, 허가·세무, 승인단계를 기록합니다.</span></button>
            <button data-jump="procurement"><b>2. 입찰참가 검토</b><span>참가자격·원가·손익·보증·세무·위험·총량한도를 확인합니다.</span></button>
            <button data-jump="reserve"><b>3. 준비금 이력관리</b><span>설정액·사용액·환입액·사용기한을 연도별로 관리합니다.</span></button>
            <button data-jump="check"><b>4. 회계점검·즉시보고</b><span>대사·증빙·예산·첨부 무결성·조달 위험을 점검하고 이상사항을 보고합니다.</span></button>
          </div>
          <div class="card rule-note"><h2>자동 통제 기준</h2><p>공공조달은 추정가격 5천만원 이상, 1회계연도 초과 계약, 차입·보증, 중대한 재정위험 또는 연간 계약총액의 직전연도 총수입 50% 초과 시 이사회 의결 대상으로 안내합니다. 기본재산 담보 관련 건은 총회·주무관청 절차까지 표시합니다.</p><div class="limit-strip"><span>직전연도 총수입 <b data-prior-income>0원</b></span><span>50% 총량한도 <b data-procurement-limit>0원</b></span><span>현재 계약누계 <b data-procurement-total>0원</b></span></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="revenue">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>REVENUE BUSINESS</p><h1>수익사업 시행·변경·중단 관리</h1><span>사업별 정관상 근거, 예상 손익, 등록·허가·세무 검토와 승인근거를 보존합니다.</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/?compose=1&template=TPL-FIN-REVENUE-BUSINESS">전자문서 검토서 작성</a></div>
          <form class="card manager-only" data-revenue-form>
            <input type="hidden" name="id" />
            <div class="form-grid four">
              <label>처리구분<select name="actionType"><option value="new">신설</option><option value="change">변경</option><option value="stop">중단</option></select></label>
              <label>사업유형<select name="businessType" required><option value="education">교육·강좌·수련</option><option value="content">출판·디지털콘텐츠</option><option value="goods">종교·문화상품</option><option value="experience">체험·명상·마음돌봄</option><option value="facility">시설사용·대관</option><option value="event">전시·공연·문화행사</option><option value="online">온라인·전자상거래</option><option value="procurement">공공조달</option><option value="preferential_purchase">우선구매 인증·지정</option><option value="other">기타</option></select></label>
              <label class="span-2">사업명<input name="title" required /></label>
              <label class="span-2">정관·규정 근거<input name="charterBasis" value="정관 제5조·제6조 / 재무회계규정 제10조의2~제10조의4" /></label>
              <label>시작일<input name="startDate" type="date" /></label><label>종료일<input name="endDate" type="date" /></label>
              <label>예상수입<input name="expectedIncome" class="money" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>예상지출<input name="expectedExpense" class="money" inputmode="numeric" /></label>
              <label>담당부서<input name="department" placeholder="예: 사무처(재정국)" /></label><label>담당자<input name="managerName" /></label>
              <label>등록·허가 검토<select name="permitStatus"><option value="review">검토중</option><option value="not_required">해당없음</option><option value="complete">완료</option></select></label>
              <label>세무 검토<select name="taxReviewStatus"><option value="review">검토중</option><option value="complete">완료</option><option value="external_review">외부전문가 검토</option></select></label>
              <label>자동 승인단계<input name="approvalLevel" data-revenue-approval value="이사회 의결" readonly /></label>
              <label>의결번호<input name="decisionNo" placeholder="이사회·총회 대상 시 입력" /></label>
              <div class="span-4 check-grid revenue-approval-checks"><label><input type="checkbox" name="routineAnnualPlan" /> 연간 사업계획·예산에 포함된 반복·통상 사업</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="majorPurposeImpact" /> 목적·주요 사업범위에 중대한 영향</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="basicPropertyImpact" /> 기본재산·중대한 시설투자 영향</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="borrowingGuaranteeImpact" /> 장기·대규모 차입·보증 수반</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="majorFinancialBurden" /> 중대한 재정부담·존립재산 영향</label></div>
              <div class="span-4 approval-inline-note" data-revenue-approval-reason>기본: 이사회 의결 · 반복·통상 사업만 이사장 승인 가능</div>
              <label>상태<select name="status"><option value="review">검토</option><option value="approved">승인</option><option value="active">운영중</option><option value="stopped">중단</option></select></label>
              <label class="span-3">비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">저장</button></div>
          </form>
          <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>수익사업 관리대장</h2><button class="btn btn-outline" data-load-revenue>새로고침</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>관리번호</th><th>사업명</th><th>구분</th><th>기간</th><th>예상수입</th><th>예상지출</th><th>승인</th><th>상태</th><th>첨부</th></tr></thead><tbody data-revenue-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="procurement">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>PUBLIC PROCUREMENT</p><h1>공공조달 입찰참가·계약 위험관리</h1><span>입찰 전 참가자격, 원가·손익, 보증, 세무, 이해관계, 승인단계와 연간 총량한도를 자동 검토합니다.</span></div><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/?compose=1&template=TPL-FIN-PROCUREMENT-REVIEW">입찰참가 검토서 작성</a></div>
          <form class="card manager-only" data-procurement-form>
            <input type="hidden" name="id" />
            <div class="form-section-title">1. 공고·계약 개요</div>
            <div class="form-grid four">
              <label>발주기관<input name="agency" required /></label><label>공고번호<input name="announcementNo" /></label><label class="span-2">공고명<input name="title" required /></label>
              <label>입찰방식<select name="bidMethod"><option value="competitive">경쟁입찰</option><option value="negotiation">협상</option><option value="quotation">견적·수의</option><option value="other">기타</option></select></label><label>입찰일<input name="bidDate" type="date" /></label><label>개찰일<input name="openingDate" type="date" /></label><label>납품기한<input name="deliveryDueDate" type="date" /></label>
              <label>추정가격<input name="estimatedPrice" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>투찰예정금액<input name="plannedBidAmount" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>계약금액<input name="actualContractAmount" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>직전연도 총수입 직접입력<input name="priorYearIncomeOverride" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" placeholder="자동계산 불가 시" /></label>
              <label>계약시작<input name="contractStart" type="date" class="preview-trigger" /></label><label>계약종료<input name="contractEnd" type="date" class="preview-trigger" /></label><label class="span-2">납품장소<input name="deliveryPlace" /></label>
              <label>연결 수익사업<select name="revenueBusinessId" data-revenue-select><option value="">선택 안 함</option></select><small>승인 이후에는 공공조달·우선구매 유형 수익사업 연결이 필수입니다.</small></label><label>연결 기존계약<select name="contractId" data-contract-select><option value="">선택 안 함</option></select><small>계약 확정 시 수익사업회계로 등록한 계약을 연결합니다.</small></label><label>상태<select name="status"><option value="review">검토</option><option value="approved">승인</option><option value="contracted">계약</option><option value="completed">완료</option><option value="withdrawn">철회</option></select></label><label>부가가치세<select name="vatStatus"><option value="review">확인필요</option><option value="taxable">과세</option><option value="exempt">면세</option></select></label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-section-title">2. 참가자격·위험 확인</div>
            <div class="check-grid">
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="businessRegistrationOk" /> 수익사업 개시신고·사업자등록 확인</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="biddingRegistrationOk" /> 입찰참가자격 등록 확인</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="qualificationOk" /> 면허·인증·직접생산 등 확인</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="competitionOk" /> 경쟁제품 등 참가가능성 확인</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="sanctionClear" /> 입찰참가 제한 등 결격사유 없음</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="charterScopeOk" /> 정관상 수익사업 범위 해당</label>
              <label><input type="checkbox" name="relatedParty" /> 이해관계인 관련성 있음</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="borrowingOrGuarantee" class="preview-trigger" /> 차입·보증 수반</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="basicPropertyCollateral" class="preview-trigger" /> 기본재산 담보 관련</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="materialFinancialRisk" class="preview-trigger" /> 중대한 재정영향 우려</label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-section-title">3. 원가·손익·세무</div>
            <div class="form-grid four">
              <label>재료·물품구입비<input name="costMaterial" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>외주·하도급비<input name="costOutsource" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>인건비<input name="costLabor" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>운반·설치·포장비<input name="costDelivery" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label>
              <label>보증료·수수료<input name="costGuarantee" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>기타 경비<input name="costOther" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>예비비<input name="costContingency" class="money preview-trigger" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label>고유목적사업준비금<select name="purposeReserveReview"><option value="review">검토필요</option><option value="applicable">설정 검토</option><option value="not_applicable">미해당</option></select></label>
              <label>이행 실패 예상손실<input name="expectedLoss" class="money" inputmode="numeric" /></label><label class="span-3">대응방안<textarea name="responsePlan"></textarea></label>
            </div>
            <div class="approval-preview"><div><span>총 원가</span><b data-preview-cost>0원</b></div><div><span>예상이익</span><b data-preview-profit>0원</b></div><div><span>예상이익률</span><b data-preview-profit-rate>0%</b></div><div><span>자동 승인단계</span><b data-preview-approval>이사장 승인</b></div><div class="wide"><span>판단사유</span><b data-preview-reasons>연간 사업계획·예산 범위 내 통상 처리</b><small data-preview-profit-warning></small></div><div><span>계약 후 연간누계</span><b data-preview-annual>0원</b></div></div>
            <div class="form-grid four">
              <label>의결번호<input name="decisionNo" /></label><label>주무관청 허가번호<input name="authorityPermitNo" /></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="nextBoardReported" /> 이사장 승인 건 다음 이사회 보고 완료</label><label>다음 이사회 보고일<input name="nextBoardReportDate" type="date" /></label><label class="span-4">비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label>
            </div>
            <div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-preview-procurement>자동검토</button><button class="btn btn-primary">저장</button></div>
          </form>
          <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>공공조달 계약관리대장</h2><button class="btn btn-outline" data-load-procurement>새로고침</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>검토번호</th><th>발주기관·공고명</th><th>추정가격</th><th>투찰/계약</th><th>승인단계</th><th>연결계약</th><th>보증</th><th>상태</th><th>관리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-procurement-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          <div class="two-cols" data-procurement-detail-area hidden>
            <form class="card manager-only" data-guarantee-form><h2>이행보증·하자보수 관리</h2><input type="hidden" name="procurementReviewId" /><div class="form-grid two"><label>보증종류<select name="guaranteeType"><option value="bid">입찰보증</option><option value="performance">계약이행보증</option><option value="advance">선금보증</option><option value="defect">하자보수보증</option></select></label><label>보증기관<input name="provider" required /></label><label>증권번호<input name="policyNo" /></label><label>보증금액<input name="amount" class="money" /></label><label>보증료<input name="fee" class="money" /></label><label>개시일<input name="startDate" type="date" /></label><label>만료일<input name="endDate" type="date" /></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="recovered" /> 회수·종료 확인</label></div><label>비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">보증자료 저장</button></div></form>
            <div class="card"><h2>선택 입찰의 보증내역</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>번호</th><th>종류</th><th>기관</th><th>금액</th><th>기간</th><th>상태</th></tr></thead><tbody data-guarantee-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          </div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="reserve">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>PURPOSE RESERVE</p><h1>고유목적사업준비금 관리대장</h1><span>설정액, 사용기한, 사용액, 환입액, 잔액과 세무검토 상태를 관리합니다.</span></div></div>
          <div class="two-cols manager-only">
            <form class="card" data-reserve-form><h2>준비금 설정</h2><input type="hidden" name="id" /><div class="form-grid two"><label>설정일<input name="setDate" type="date" required /></label><label>설정액<input name="setAmount" class="money" required /></label><label>사용기한<input name="useDeadline" type="date" /></label><label>재원<select name="fundId" data-fund-select></select></label><label>세무검토<select name="taxReviewStatus"><option value="review">검토필요</option><option value="complete">검토완료</option><option value="external_review">세무사·회계사 검토</option></select></label><label>검토자<input name="reviewer" /></label></div><label>비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">설정자료 저장</button></div></form>
            <form class="card" data-reserve-tx-form><h2>사용·환입 등록</h2><label>준비금<select name="reserveId" data-reserve-select required><option value="">선택</option></select></label><div class="form-grid two"><label>구분<select name="transactionType"><option value="use">목적사업 사용</option><option value="reversal">환입</option></select></label><label>일자<input name="transactionDate" type="date" required /></label><label>금액<input name="amount" class="money" required /></label><label>연결 지출결의 ID<input name="resolutionId" placeholder="선택 입력" /></label></div><label>사용·환입 사유<textarea name="purpose" required></textarea></label><label>비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">등록</button></div></form>
          </div>
          <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>준비금 관리대장</h2><button class="btn btn-outline" data-load-reserves>새로고침</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>관리번호</th><th>설정일</th><th>설정액</th><th>사용액</th><th>환입액</th><th>잔액</th><th>사용기한</th><th>세무검토</th><th>첨부</th></tr></thead><tbody data-reserve-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="check">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>ACCOUNTING CHECK</p><h1>월별·분기별 회계점검 및 중요사항 즉시보고</h1><span>기존 회계데이터를 이용해 대사·증빙·예산·첨부무결성·조달위험을 자동 집계하고 시정조치 이력을 남깁니다.</span></div><div class="heading-actions"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/?compose=1&template=TPL-FIN-MONTHLY-CHECK">점검보고서 작성</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/?compose=1&template=TPL-FIN-IMMEDIATE-REPORT">즉시보고서 작성</a></div></div>
          <form class="card manager-only" data-check-form><input type="hidden" name="id" /><div class="form-grid four"><label>기간구분<select name="periodType"><option value="month">월별</option><option value="quarter">분기별</option></select></label><label>기간값<input name="periodKey" value="01" placeholder="01 또는 Q1" /></label><label>상태<select name="status"><option value="open">보완중</option><option value="completed">점검완료</option></select></label><div class="inline-checks"><label><input type="checkbox" name="reportedChairman" /> 이사장 보고</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="reportedAuditor" /> 감사 보고</label></div></div><div class="snapshot-grid" data-check-snapshot><div><span>기간 수입</span><b data-snap-income>0원</b></div><div><span>기간 지출</span><b data-snap-expense>0원</b></div><div><span>후원금·보시금 수입</span><b data-snap-donation>0원</b></div><div><span>수익사업 세무설정</span><b data-snap-taxprofile>정상</b></div><div><span>예금잔액</span><b data-snap-balance>0원</b></div><div><span>미대사</span><b data-snap-unmatched>0건</b></div><div><span>증빙누락</span><b data-snap-evidence>0건</b></div><div><span>예산초과</span><b data-snap-overbudget>0건</b></div><div><span>예산변경대기</span><b data-snap-budget>0건</b></div><div><span>첨부무결성</span><b data-snap-integrity>0건</b></div><div><span>조달위험</span><b data-snap-procurement>0건</b></div><div><span>미종결 즉시보고</span><b data-snap-incident>0건</b></div></div><label>점검결과·이상사항<textarea name="findings"></textarea></label><label>보완·시정조치<textarea name="correctiveAction"></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><button type="button" class="btn btn-outline" data-preview-check>자동점검</button><button class="btn btn-primary">점검결과 저장</button></div></form>
          <div class="two-cols">
            <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>회계점검 이력</h2><button class="btn btn-outline" data-load-checks>새로고침</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>점검번호</th><th>기간</th><th>핵심 이상</th><th>보고</th><th>상태</th><th>첨부</th></tr></thead><tbody data-check-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
            <form class="card manager-only" data-incident-form><h2>중요 회계사항 즉시보고</h2><input type="hidden" name="id" /><div class="form-grid two"><label>유형<select name="category"><option>법인계좌 이상거래</option><option>미정산·증빙누락·목적외사용 우려</option><option>예산 현저 초과</option><option>이해관계인 거래 위험</option><option>후원금·보시금·목적기부금 지정목적 위반 우려</option><option>법인재산·개인재산 혼용 우려</option><option>공공조달 이행지체·계약해지·입찰제한 우려</option><option>기타 중대한 재정사항</option></select></label><label>발견일시<input name="occurredAt" type="datetime-local" /></label></div><label>제목<input name="title" required /></label><label>상세내용<textarea name="detail" required></textarea></label><label>즉시조치<textarea name="immediateAction"></textarea></label><div class="inline-checks"><label><input type="checkbox" name="chairmanNotified" /> 이사장 보고</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="auditorNotified" /> 감사 보고</label><label>상태 <select name="status"><option value="open">조치중</option><option value="resolved">종결</option></select></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">즉시보고 저장</button></div></form>
          </div>
          <div class="card"><h2>즉시보고 이력</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>보고번호</th><th>일시</th><th>유형</th><th>제목</th><th>보고여부</th><th>상태</th><th>첨부</th></tr></thead><tbody data-incident-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
        </section>

        <section class="panel" data-panel="vehicle">
          <div class="heading"><div><p>BUSINESS VEHICLE</p><h1>업무용 차량 임차·리스·구입 및 운행관리</h1><span>계약·자산·보험·운행기록과 임차권 승계 검토를 한 화면에서 연결합니다.</span></div><div class="heading-actions"><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/?compose=1&template=TPL-FIN-VEHICLE-REVIEW">차량 검토서 작성</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href="/?compose=1&template=TPL-FIN-VEHICLE-SUCCESSION">승계 검토서 작성</a></div></div>
          <form class="card manager-only" data-vehicle-form><input type="hidden" name="id" /><div class="form-grid four"><label>관리유형<select name="managementType"><option value="rental">임차·렌트</option><option value="lease">리스</option><option value="owned">구입·보유</option></select></label><label>차종·차량명<input name="modelName" required /></label><label>차량번호<input name="plateNo" /></label><label>주사용자<input name="primaryUser" /></label><label>계약시작<input name="contractStart" type="date" /></label><label>계약종료<input name="contractEnd" type="date" /></label><label>월비용<input name="monthlyCost" class="money" /></label><label>보험사<input name="insurer" /></label><label>보험만료일<input name="insuranceEnd" type="date" /></label><label>연결 자산<select name="assetId" data-asset-select><option value="">선택 안 함</option></select></label><label>연결 계약<select name="contractId" data-vehicle-contract-select><option value="">선택 안 함</option></select></label><label>상태<select name="status"><option value="active">사용중</option><option value="returned">반납</option><option value="disposed">처분</option></select></label><label class="span-4">업무용도<textarea name="purpose" required></textarea></label><label>승인단계<select name="approvalLevel"><option value="auto">규정에 따라 자동판단</option><option value="secretary_general">사무총장 전결</option><option value="chairman">이사장 승인</option><option value="board">이사회 의결</option></select></label><label>의결번호<input name="decisionNo" /></label><label class="check"><input type="checkbox" name="renewalFlag" /> 계속·반복 갱신 계약</label><label>승계희망자<input name="successionCandidate" /></label><label>승계대가<input name="successionPrice" class="money" /></label><label>승계 이사회 의결번호<input name="successionDecisionNo" /></label><label class="span-2">승계대가 산정근거<textarea name="successionPriceBasis" placeholder="잔여 리스료·보증금·정산금·시세 등 객관적 산정근거"></textarea></label><div class="span-2 inline-checks"><label><input type="checkbox" name="successionCounterpartyConsent" /> 계약상대방 승계 동의 확인</label><label><input type="checkbox" name="successionNoLoss" /> 법인 신규채무·손실 없음 확인</label></div><label class="span-4">비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label></div><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">차량자료 저장</button></div></form>
          <div class="card"><div class="card-head"><h2>업무용 차량 관리대장</h2><button class="btn btn-outline" data-load-vehicles>새로고침</button></div><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>관리번호</th><th>차량</th><th>유형</th><th>사용자</th><th>계약기간</th><th>보험만료</th><th>운행기록</th><th>상태</th><th>관리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-vehicle-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          <div class="two-cols" data-vehicle-detail-area hidden>
            <form class="card manager-only" data-vehicle-log-form><h2>운행기록 등록</h2><input type="hidden" name="vehicleId" /><div class="form-grid two"><label>운행일<input name="useDate" type="date" required /></label><label>운전자<input name="driver" required /></label><label>운행구간<input name="route" /></label><label>주행거리(km)<input name="distanceKm" type="number" min="0" step="0.1" /></label></div><label>운행목적<textarea name="purpose" required></textarea></label><label>비고<textarea name="memo"></textarea></label><div class="form-actions"><button class="btn btn-primary">운행기록 저장</button></div></form>
            <div class="card"><h2>선택 차량 운행일지</h2><div class="table-wrap"><table><thead><tr><th>운행일</th><th>운전자</th><th>목적</th><th>구간</th><th>거리</th></tr></thead><tbody data-vehicle-log-rows></tbody></table></div></div>
          </div>
        </section>
      </main>
    </div>
  </div>

  <script is:inline>
    (()=>{
      'use strict';
      const STORAGE_KEY='milgyo-system-session';
      const session=(()=>{try{return JSON.parse(localStorage.getItem(STORAGE_KEY)||'null')}catch{return null}})();
      if(!session?.token||!session?.user){location.replace('/');return;}
      const token=session.token,me=session.user;
      const $=(s,r=document)=>r.querySelector(s),$$=(s,r=document)=>Array.from(r.querySelectorAll(s));
      const esc=(v)=>String(v??'').replace(/[&<>"']/g,(c)=>({'&':'&amp;','<':'&lt;','>':'&gt;','"':'&quot;',"'":'&#39;'}[c]));
      const won=(v)=>`${Number(v||0).toLocaleString('ko-KR')}원`;
      const money=(v)=>{const n=Number(String(v??'').replace(/[^0-9.-]/g,''));return Number.isFinite(n)?Math.round(n):0};
      const today=()=>new Date(Date.now()+9*60*60*1000).toISOString().slice(0,10);
      const currentYear=Number(today().slice(0,4));
      let state={year:currentYear,permissions:{},summary:{},books:[],entities:[],funds:[],contracts:[],assets:[],revenueBusinesses:[],procurements:[],reserves:[],vehicles:[]};
      const api=async(path,body)=>{const res=await fetch(path,{method:'POST',headers:{'Content-Type':'application/json'},body:JSON.stringify({...body,token})});const text=await res.text();let data;try{data=JSON.parse(text)}catch{data={ok:false,message:`서버 응답 오류(HTTP ${res.status})`}}if(!data.ok)throw new Error(data.message||'처리 중 오류가 발생했습니다.');return data};
      const notice=(message,type='ok')=>{const el=$('[data-notice]');el.textContent=message;el.className=`notice ${type}`;el.hidden=false;clearTimeout(notice.timer);notice.timer=setTimeout(()=>el.hidden=true,5200)};
      const body=(form)=>{const o={};new FormData(form).forEach((v,k)=>o[k]=v);$$('input[type="checkbox"]',form).forEach((el)=>o[el.name]=el.checked);return o};
      const setMoneyFormatting=(root=document)=>{$$('.money',root).forEach((el)=>{if(el.dataset.moneyBound)return;el.dataset.moneyBound='1';el.addEventListener('input',()=>{const raw=el.value.replace(/[^0-9-]/g,'');if(!raw||raw==='-')return;el.value=Number(raw).toLocaleString('ko-KR')});});};
      const fill=(form,row,map={})=>{for(const [key,value] of Object.entries(row||{})){const name=map[key]||key.replace(/_([a-z])/g,(_,c)=>c.toUpperCase());const el=form.elements.namedItem(name);if(!el)continue;if(el.type==='checkbox')el.checked=!!Number(value);else el.value=value??'';}setMoneyFormatting(form)};
      const statusLabel=(v)=>({review:'검토',approved:'승인',active:'운영중',stopped:'중단',contracted:'계약',completed:'완료',withdrawn:'철회',open:'조치중',resolved:'종결',returned:'반납',disposed:'처분'}[v]||v||'-');
      const approvalLabel=(v)=>({secretary_general:'사무총장 전결',chairman:'이사장 승인',board:'이사회 의결',general_meeting:'총회·주무관청'}[v]||v||'-');
      const typeLabel=(v)=>({new:'신설',change:'변경',stop:'중단',owned:'구입·보유',lease:'리스',rental:'임차·렌트',bid:'입찰보증',performance:'계약이행',advance:'선금보증',defect:'하자보수',use:'사용',reversal:'환입'}[v]||v||'-');
      const revenueApprovalPreview=()=>{const f=$('[data-revenue-form]');if(!f)return;const reasons=[];if(f.majorPurposeImpact.checked)reasons.push('목적·주요 사업범위 중대영향');if(f.basicPropertyImpact.checked)reasons.push('기본재산·중대한 시설투자');if(f.borrowingGuaranteeImpact.checked)reasons.push('장기·대규모 차입·보증');if(f.majorFinancialBurden.checked)reasons.push('중대한 재정부담');const preferential=f.businessType.value==='preferential_purchase';const routineEligible=f.routineAnnualPlan.checked&&f.actionType.value==='new'&&!preferential;const level=reasons.length?'general_meeting':routineEligible?'chairman':'board';$('[data-revenue-approval]').value=approvalLabel(level);$('[data-revenue-approval-reason]').textContent=reasons.length?`총회 승인 검토: ${reasons.join(' / ')}`:preferential&&f.routineAnnualPlan.checked?'우선구매 인증·지정은 이사회 의결 대상입니다.':f.routineAnnualPlan.checked&&f.actionType.value!=='new'?'변경·중단은 반복·통상 예외 없이 이사회 의결 대상입니다.':routineEligible?'연간 사업계획·예산 내 반복·통상 시행: 이사장 승인':'신설·중요 변경·중단 기본: 이사회 의결';};
      const attachButton=(type,id,title,category='general')=>`<button type="button" class="btn btn-mini" data-generic-attachments data-reference-type="${esc(type)}" data-reference-id="${esc(id)}" data-reference-title="${esc(title)}" data-file-category="${esc(category)}">첨부</button>`;
      const empty=(cols,msg='자료가 없습니다.')=>`<tr><td colspan="${cols}" class="empty">${msg}</td></tr>`;
      const setTab=(name)=>{$$('.nav').forEach((b)=>b.classList.toggle('active',b.dataset.tab===name));$$('.panel').forEach((p)=>p.classList.toggle('active',p.dataset.panel===name));loadTab(name).catch((e)=>notice(e.message,'error'))};
      $$('.nav').forEach((b)=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>setTab(b.dataset.tab)));$$('[data-jump]').forEach((b)=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>setTab(b.dataset.jump)));
      $('[data-logout]').addEventListener('click',()=>{localStorage.removeItem(STORAGE_KEY);location.replace('/')});
      const updateSummary=()=>{const s=state.summary||{};$('[data-summary-revenue]').textContent=`${Number(s.revenue_businesses||0)}건`;$('[data-summary-procurement]').textContent=`${Number(s.procurements||0)}건`;$('[data-summary-reserve]').textContent=won(s.reserve_balance);$('[data-summary-check]').textContent=`${Number(s.checks||0)+Number(s.incidents||0)}건`;$('[data-summary-vehicle]').textContent=`${Number(s.vehicles||0)}대`;$('[data-summary-guarantee]').textContent=`${Number(s.expiring_guarantees||0)}건`;};
      const renderMasterOptions=()=>{
        $('[data-fund-select]').innerHTML=state.funds.map((x)=>`<option value="${esc(x.id)}" ${x.id==='FUND-RESERVE'?'selected':''}>${esc(x.name)}</option>`).join('');
        const contracts='<option value="">선택 안 함</option>'+state.contracts.map((x)=>`<option value="${esc(x.id)}">${esc(x.contract_no)} · ${esc(x.title)} · ${esc(x.book_type_name||x.book_type_code||'')}</option>`).join('');$('[data-contract-select]').innerHTML=contracts;$('[data-vehicle-contract-select]').innerHTML=contracts;
        $('[data-asset-select]').innerHTML='<option value="">선택 안 함</option>'+state.assets.map((x)=>`<option value="${esc(x.id)}">${esc(x.asset_no)} · ${esc(x.name)}</option>`).join('');
      };
      const init=async()=>{const data=await api('/api/accounting-compliance/query',{action:'init',year:state.year});state={...state,...data,permissions:data.permissions||{},summary:data.summary||{}};$('[data-user-label]').textContent=`${me.name}${me.position?' · '+me.position:''}`;document.body.classList.toggle('read-only',!state.permissions.manager);$$('.manager-only').forEach((el)=>el.hidden=!state.permissions.manager);const yearSel=$('[data-year]');yearSel.innerHTML=(data.fiscalYears?.length?data.fiscalYears.map((x)=>x.year):[currentYear-1,currentYear,currentYear+1]).map((y)=>`<option value="${y}" ${Number(y)===state.year?'selected':''}>${y}년</option>`).join('');$('[data-prior-income]').textContent=won(data.priorYearIncome);$('[data-procurement-limit]').textContent=won(data.annualProcurementLimit);$('[data-procurement-total]').textContent=won(data.annualProcurementTotal);renderMasterOptions();updateSummary();$('[data-app]').hidden=false;setMoneyFormatting();revenueApprovalPreview();await Promise.all([loadRevenue(),loadProcurement(),loadReserves(),loadChecks(),loadIncidents(),loadVehicles()]);};
      $('[data-year]').addEventListener('change',async(e)=>{state.year=Number(e.target.value);await init();setTab($('.nav.active')?.dataset.tab||'overview')});
      const loadTab=async(name)=>{if(name==='revenue')await loadRevenue();if(name==='procurement')await loadProcurement();if(name==='reserve')await loadReserves();if(name==='check')await Promise.all([loadChecks(),loadIncidents()]);if(name==='vehicle')await loadVehicles();};

      const loadRevenue=async()=>{const data=await api('/api/accounting-compliance/query',{action:'revenue-businesses',year:state.year});state.revenueBusinesses=data.rows||[];$('[data-revenue-rows]').innerHTML=state.revenueBusinesses.length?state.revenueBusinesses.map((r)=>`<tr><td>${esc(r.business_no)}</td><td><button class="text-link" data-edit-revenue="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.title)}</button></td><td>${esc(typeLabel(r.action_type))}</td><td>${esc(r.start_date||'-')} ~ ${esc(r.end_date||'-')}</td><td class="num">${won(r.expected_income)}</td><td class="num">${won(r.expected_expense)}</td><td>${esc(approvalLabel(r.approval_level))}${r.approval_reasons?`<br><small>${esc(r.approval_reasons)}</small>`:''}</td><td>${esc(statusLabel(r.status))}</td><td>${attachButton('revenue_business',r.id,r.business_no,'report')}</td></tr>`).join(''):empty(9);$('[data-revenue-select]').innerHTML='<option value="">선택 안 함</option>'+state.revenueBusinesses.map((r)=>`<option value="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.business_no)} · ${esc(r.title)}</option>`).join('');$$('[data-edit-revenue]').forEach((b)=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>{const row=state.revenueBusinesses.find((r)=>r.id===b.dataset.editRevenue);if(row){fill($('[data-revenue-form]'),row);revenueApprovalPreview()}window.scrollTo({top:0,behavior:'smooth'})}));};
      $$('[data-revenue-form] input[type="checkbox"]').forEach((el)=>el.addEventListener('change',revenueApprovalPreview));$('[data-revenue-form] [name="actionType"]').addEventListener('change',revenueApprovalPreview);$('[data-revenue-form] [name="businessType"]').addEventListener('change',revenueApprovalPreview);
      $('[data-load-revenue]').addEventListener('click',()=>loadRevenue().catch((e)=>notice(e.message,'error')));$('[data-revenue-form]').addEventListener('submit',async(e)=>{e.preventDefault();try{const data=await api('/api/accounting-compliance/action',{action:'save-revenue-business',year:state.year,...body(e.currentTarget)});notice(`${data.message} 승인단계: ${approvalLabel(data.approvalLevel)}`);e.currentTarget.reset();e.currentTarget.elements.id.value='';revenueApprovalPreview();await Promise.all([loadRevenue(),initSummaryOnly()])}catch(err){notice(err.message,'error')}});

      const loadProcurement=async()=>{const data=await api('/api/accounting-compliance/query',{action:'procurements',year:state.year});state.procurements=data.rows||[];$('[data-prior-income]').textContent=won(data.priorYearIncome);$('[data-procurement-limit]').textContent=won(data.annualLimit);$('[data-procurement-total]').textContent=won(data.annualTotal);$('[data-procurement-rows]').innerHTML=state.procurements.length?state.procurements.map((r)=>`<tr><td>${esc(r.review_no)}</td><td><button class="text-link" data-view-procurement="${esc(r.id)}">${esc(r.agency)}<br><small>${esc(r.title)}</small></button></td><td class="num">${won(r.estimated_price)}</td><td class="num">${won(r.actual_contract_amount||r.planned_bid_amount)}</td><td>${esc(approvalLabel(r.approval_level))}${r.approval_reasons?`<br><small>${esc(r.approval_reasons)}</small>`:''}${r.approval_level==='chairman'?`<br><small>${r.next_board_reported?'다음 이사회 보고완료':'다음 이사회 보고대기'}</small>`:''}</td><td>${esc(r.contract_no||'-')}</td><td>${Number(r.guarantee_count||0)}건</td><td>${esc(statusLabel(r.status))}</td><td>${attachButton('procurement_review',r.id,r.review_no,'contract')}</td></tr>`).join(''):empty(9);$$('[data-view-procurement]').forEach((b)=>b.addEventListener('click',()=>openProcurement(b.dataset.viewProcurement)));};
      const previewProcurement=async()=>{const form=$('[data-procurement-form]');const data=await api('/api/accounting-compliance/query',{action:'procurement-preview',year:state.year,...body(form)});$('[data-preview-cost]').textContent=won(data.totalCost);$('[data-preview-profit]').textContent=won(data.expectedProfit);$('[data-preview-profit-rate]').textContent=`${data.expectedProfitRate}%`;$('[data-preview-approval]').textContent=approvalLabel(data.approval.approvalLevel);$('[data-preview-reasons]').textContent=data.approval.reasons.length?data.approval.reasons.join(' / '):'연간 사업계획·예산 범위 내 통상 처리';$('[data-preview-annual]').textContent=`${won(data.approval.annualAfter)} / 한도 ${won(data.approval.annualLimit)}`;$('[data-preview-profit-warning]').textContent=data.profitWarning||'';$('[data-preview-profit-warning]').className=data.profitWarning?'negative':'';};
      $('[data-preview-procurement]').addEventListener('click',()=>previewProcurement().catch((e)=>notice(e.message,'error')));$$('.preview-trigger').forEach((el)=>el.addEventListener('change',()=>previewProcurement().catch(()=>{})));$('[data-load-procurement]').addEventListener('click',()=>loadProcurement().catch((e)=>notice(e.message,'error')));$('[data-procurement-form]').addEventListener('submit',async(e)=>{e.preventDefault();try{const data=await api('/api/accounting-compliance/action',{action:'save-procurement',year:state.year,...body(e.currentTarget)});notice(`${data.message} 승인단계: ${approvalLabel(data.approval.approvalLevel)}`);e.currentTarget.reset();e.currentTarget.elements.id.value='';await Promise.all([loadProcurement(),initSummaryOnly()]);await previewProcurement()}catch(err){notice(err.message,'error')}});
